{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n164.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"While the reader carries a Torah scroll to the reading desk, the congregation says:"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n164.jpg","n":"71"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/opening"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Above all things let there be magnified, sanctified, praised, glorified, exalted and elevated the Name of the King of all kings, the Holy One, blessed be He, in the worlds that He created in this and the future world, according to His will and the will of those who fear Him and the will of the whole house of Israel. Rock of eternity, Lord of all creatures, God "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n166.jpg","n":"72"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"of all souls, who dwells in the infinite heights, and resides in the primaeval heavens, His holiness is above the Hayoth, His holiness is above the glorious throne. And thus may Thy Name be sanctified among us, O Lord our God, before the eyes of all the living; and let us sing before Him a new song, as it is written: ‘"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"68","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/shiru"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"5","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/shiru/5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/68/5"}}
{"text":"Sing to God, sing praise of His Name. Exalt Him who rides upon the clouds, Yah is His Name, and rejoice before Him."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  We shall see Him eye to eye when He returns to His dwelling as it is written:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"52","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/ayin"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"8","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/ayin/8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"half-verse","n":"b","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/ayin/8/b"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/52/8/b"}}
{"text":"eye to eye shall they behold when the Lord returns to Zion."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"half-verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  And it was said: ‘"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"40","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/veniglah"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"5","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/veniglah/5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/40/5"}}
{"text":"And the glory of the Lord shall be revealed and all flesh together shall see, for the mouth of the Lord has spoken"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"’. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
